#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/3-gazebo_sim.md:28
#: 88de89927b0448858a93f440ae291e3d
msgid ""
"`hardware:=gz` sets xacro `ros2_control_hardware_type` to `gz` and "
"`gazebo` to `true` ([`build_xacro_mappings()`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/robot_common_launch/common/launch_arg_utils.py))."
" [ocs2_arm README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md):"
" install `ros-jazzy-ros-gz` and `ros-jazzy-gz-ros2-control`."
msgstr ""
"`hardware:=gz` 将 xacro `ros2_control_hardware_type` 设为 `gz`，并将 `gazebo` "
"设为 `true`（[`build_xacro_mappings()`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/robot_common_launch/common/launch_arg_utils.py)）。[ocs2_arm"
" README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md)：安装"
" `ros-jazzy-ros-gz` 和 `ros-jazzy-gz-ros2-control`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/3-gazebo_sim.md:30
#: 759f112b936d4ae0bc6cb91f941b00ce
msgid "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=gz\n"
msgstr "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=gz\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/3-gazebo_sim.md:34
#: 2663ec62334c49ddb11209a6d88b1081
msgid ""
"Acone xacro plugin for this key: `gz_ros2_control/GazeboSimSystem`. `gz` "
"is a launch key, not a vendor driver-layer package — [Driver "
"layer](../../4-reference/hardware/0-index.md)."
msgstr ""
"Acone xacro 在此键下的插件：`gz_ros2_control/GazeboSimSystem`。`gz` 是 launch 键，不是厂商驱动层包 "
"— [驱动层](../../4-reference/hardware/0-index.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/3-gazebo_sim.md:36
#: 7592a2c0177d48cfbe9dcb1e34a88786
