msgstr "3. 交互"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/3-gazebo_sim.md:38
#: 90373d7c0b7b47749415ab311ab07dc7
msgid ""
"FSM: `/fsm_command` (`std_msgs/Int32`). Do **not** publish "
"`/target_pose`. See [FSM and "
"Topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)."
msgstr ""
"FSM：`/fsm_command`（`std_msgs/Int32`）。**不要**发布 `/target_pose`。见 [FSM "
"与话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)。"

